{title: I Have Found The Way}
{key: F}
{x_theme: praise, heaven, faith-trust}
{x_source: chrd:i_have_found_the_way.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]I have found the way
[Bb]That leads to endless [F]day,
Yonder in the glory-[C]land;
And the [F]road is bright,
[Bb]For Jesus is the [F]light,
[F]And I hold His guiding hand.

{comment: Chorus}
[Bb]I have [F]found the way,
[F]I have [C]found the way,
[Bb]Glory halle[F]lujah,
[F]I have [C]found the way.

{comment: Verse 2}
[F]I will never fear,
[Bb]While Jesus is so [F]near,
I will bravely meet the [C]foe;
Happy [F]songs I'll sing,
[Bb]In honor to the [F]King,
[F]And to glory onward go.

{comment: Verse 3}
[F]To the journey's end,
[Bb]Led by a faithful [F]Friend,
Nevermore in sin to [C]roam;
By the [F]way called straight,
[Bb]I'll reach the [F]golden gate
[F]Of the soul's eternal home.
